## Preamble

This license is designed to balance open collaboration with sustainable development. It grants broad permissions for personal, educational, and internal commercial use while protecting the long-term viability of the Maxilun project. This license is inspired by modern source-available licenses that prioritize developer freedom alongside project sustainability.

---

## 1. Definitions

**"Software"** means the Maxilun source code, documentation, skills, rules, templates, and associated files distributed under this license, including any updates or modifications made available by Maxilun Architecture.

**"You"** or **"Your"** means an individual or legal entity exercising permissions granted by this license.

**"Contribution"** means any work of authorship, including the original version of the Software and any modifications or additions to it, intentionally submitted to Maxilun Architecture for inclusion in the Software.

**"Commercial Use"** means using the Software to generate revenue, including but not limited to: selling products or services built with the Software, offering consulting or implementation services involving the Software, or using the Software in revenue-generating business operations.

**"Managed Service"** means offering the Software itself, or a substantially similar product, as a hosted service, SaaS, PaaS, API, or platform where the primary value proposition is the Software's core functionality.

**"Derivative Work"** means any modification, adaptation, translation, or enhancement of the Software that is based upon or incorporates all or a substantial portion of the Software.

**"Internal Use"** means use within Your organization for non-revenue-generating purposes, including development, testing, evaluation, research, education, and internal tooling.

